OL,3,GNEWSABalloons take to blue skies for
OL,4,Aannual carnival
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of balloons took to the skies
OL,7,Fabove sunny Oswestry for the town's
OL,8,F10th balloon carnival.
OL,10,FThe free two-day event in Cae Glas Park
OL,11,Fon Saturday and Sunday was organised by
OL,12,FNightingale House Hospice, the town
OL,13,Fcouncil and the local business
OL,14,Fimprovement district.
OL,16,FAlthough some flights did not get
OL,17,Fairborne over the weekend, because of
OL,18,Fhigh winds, it was all clear for the
OL,19,Flaunch of the event on Saturday
OL,20,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
